    Fix default value for error states
    
    The PR #7450 changed the behaviour regarding error states.
    It states that the default value is "disabled", but it is the
    opposite. I ran into a problem where a service did run into a
    problem and the service state were immediately set to `error`.
    After changing the default value to "disabeld", everything
    worked as expected.
